# Theme: Plain
# Neutral role names with no fandom: just what each agent does.
Relay|Relay|#2E8B8B|The one you talk to; passes your words on and never does the work.
Dispatcher|Dispatcher|#B8860B|Reads each brief and routes it to the right worker by difficulty.
Architect|Architect|#6A5ACD|Designs the structure first, so builders do not guess.
BuilderHeavy|BuilderHeavy|#C0392B|Takes on the large, hard builds and sees them through.
BuilderPrecise|BuilderPrecise|#2874A6|Handles exacting builds where every detail matters.
Reviewer|Reviewer|#7D6608|Reads each change and flags what is wrong or risky.
Writer|Writer|#AF5FA0|Writes clear documentation others will read.
Runner|Runner|#D2691E|Runs tests and commands, and reports exactly what happened.
Scribe|Scribe|#3C8D5A|Records every decision so nothing is forgotten.
BackendCritic|BackendCritic|#8E44AD|Challenges backend design: data, APIs, and failure modes.
FrontendCritic|FrontendCritic|#CD5C5C|Challenges the UI: layout, accessibility, and polish.
SecurityCritic|SecurityCritic|#5D6D7E|Looks for ways in, thinking like an attacker.
ScopeCritic|ScopeCritic|#B03060|Checks that the work matches what was asked, no more.
BlindReviewer|BlindReviewer|#708090|Reviews with no prior context, so assumptions show up.
Keeper|Keeper|#A0522D|Keeps the official record tidy and trustworthy.
Observer|Observer|#4682B4|Watches everything and never acts.
Housekeeper|Housekeeper|#E67E22|Cleans up leftovers, stale files, and loose ends.
Tutor|Tutor|#1F6FB2|Explains and guides, and does not do the task for you.
Watcher|Watcher|#9C2D2D|Keeps watch after a merge for anything that breaks.
Coach|Coach|#8A7A1E|Improves the other agents' prompts based on how they performed.
